{"title":"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The symbolism <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/06681f5b345750104366c512078960fee8d81b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denotes the largest integer not exceeding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/8/da866a780b2f5c82a950a5e833063f11d1d29d2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 3 \\rfloor = 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/d/98d4088b0d795ba32c3a8807c8b0e11e2a49cbf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 9/2 \\rfloor = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />. Compute\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a58d1e1c98abd63840c9b83573e068bb7408aea6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor \\sqrt{1} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\sqrt{2} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\sqrt{3} \\rfloor + \\cdots + \\lfloor \\sqrt{16} \\rfloor.\\]\" width=\"281\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2d215d2bf05792ec6f8027428ed602e32222ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 38 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 40 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 42 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 136$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"407\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three values in the sum are equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bf27edd6ee0c25241392922eca9b9c9144f4d73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the next five equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1d1407aac4125d6c453a365eb173d96ebb48e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the next seven equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/8/2f885f96d2fb7e65f800de4ff71d7dcd0a5d2db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> and the last one equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb15a16cca90d201094265ee529e9e2cfb113de8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> For example, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fcc33a7c840ca476cc3df92991ac6edc1acb78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> any square root of a number less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e4797950b5e812b65381cbc5fc33ad2db5f57aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> Sum them all together to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffbd6bff0dc51c1c4487240a68ffad24446e9b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\cdot1 + 5\\cdot2 + 7\\cdot3 + 1\\cdot4 = 3+10+21+4 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) \\ } 38}\\]\" width=\"432\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<hr />\n<p>We are asked to compute: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3899c02aff5337672a14cf88aa5d618f324382.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{16} \\lfloor \\sqrt{k} \\rfloor\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 1: Evaluate each term individually**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d7a0ee6c6bda59568cbd3cf10621667095acbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor \\sqrt{1} \\rfloor = 1 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{2} \\rfloor = 1 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{3} \\rfloor = 1 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{4} \\rfloor = 2 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{5} \\rfloor = 2 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{6} \\rfloor = 2 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{7} \\rfloor = 2 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{8} \\rfloor = 2 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{9} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{10} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{11} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{12} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{13} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{14} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{15} \\rfloor = 3 \\\\ \\lfloor \\sqrt{16} \\rfloor = 4\\]\" width=\"1240\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 2: Group repeated values**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>1+1+1 = 3  \n</p><p>2+2+2+2+2 = 10  \n</p><p>3+3+3+3+3+3+3 = 21  \n</p><p>4 = 4\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 3: Add them together**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>3 + 10 + 21 + 4 = 38\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Answer:**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/923c6b181f8d85f4f320d68cd51fe00675988093.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{38}\\]\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B\">2003 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a><